  "bio": "Jennifer Davis, known for her expertise in minimalist, lettering, and realism styles, is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Cranford, United States. Holding an AAM certification since 2015, she specializes in both cosmetic tattoos—including brows, eyeliner, and areola restoration—and body art, where she honed her mastery as an apprentice. Clients seeking exceptional tattoos can find Jennifer at Lost and Found Tattoo Studio, where her professionalism ensures every session meets the highest standards of artistry and care.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cranford, New Jersey, United States",
  "tattooing_since": "2015"
